Why did you create a separate CartPage class
?

You can answer:

"I used the Page Object Model to maintain separate classes for different application pages. CartPage encapsulates cart-related locators and actions, making the framework reusable and easier to maintain."

Remove product from cart
driver.findElements(locator).isEmpty()


Why?
- findElement() element nahi milne par exception throw karta hai.
- findElements() element nahi milne par empty list return karta hai.
- isEmpty() check karta hai ki list empty hai ya nahi.
Yahan hum verify kar rahe hain ki product remove hone ke baad cart mein koi item nahi hai.

